# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit the real value.
#
# CARTO basemap key. Optional: without it the maps fall back to Esri's keyless
# dark canvas, which is knocked back in src/lib/basemap.js but is not a pixel
# match for the Sonar app. With it, CARTO dark_all leads and the two match.
#
# Free from https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey — 5m tile requests/month, granted
# against a domain. The Sonar project already has one; the same key works here.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
